{
  "description": "Mobile 390x844 portrait, DPR 3, touch, R-49-R-51: grouping, layer order and alignment through the compact property bar's Actions popover, by the exact button names that s22 saved. Draws rectangles A [40,120,120,80], B [100,180,120,80] and C [160,240,120,80], stored in that order. Selects A by a tap on its left stroke (40,160) after a deselecting tap, and before each of Bring forward, Bring to front, Send backward and Send to back, so that every action starts from a closed popover; then undoes and redoes the last one with the Undo and Redo buttons. Box-selects all three with a one-finger drag from (20,100) to (300,340), saves the Actions popover for three elements, then applies Align left, Align top, Center vertically and Distribute horizontally, each from a fresh box selection and each followed by Undo. Groups all three, taps A's stroke to see what a tap on a group member selects, undoes and redoes the grouping, and ungroups. Reads the scene, whose element order is the stored order, and the app state after each step. Runs right after 09 in a fresh session (zoom 1, scroll 0,0, empty canvas).",
